W standard_natural_numbers%s  standard_natural_numbers.adb  standard_natural_numbers.ali
W standard_root_refiners%s  standard_root_refiners.adb  standard_root_refiners.ali
W standard_simpomial_solvers%s  standard_simpomial_solvers.adb  standard_simpomial_solvers.ali

